## Approach

- Make this a **discoverability-only** fix.
- Do not change runtime code, test behavior, or lint logic.
- Put each convention where the matching author will see it:
  - **Design authors** get the fence-harness requirement before plans are handed to external coders.
  - **Claude in-repo implementers** get the same reminder before editing implement fences.
  - **Python test authors** get the pyright lambda pattern before adding strict-mode test monkeypatches.

